@NovaKnowledge.Feedback.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5005

### Submit feedback for a message
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Feedback.Api_HostAddress}}/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messageId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "tenantId": "contoso", "rating": 1, "comment": "Accurate and cited." }

### Export feedback as JSONL
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Feedback.Api_HostAddress}}/api/feedback/export?days=7
Accept: application/json

###
